{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A desperate hunt. A wild world. A bond worth fighting for.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tribe of the Accord is a pixel-art action game set in a <strong>Stone Age world teeming with danger and discovery</strong>. As <strong>Adira</strong>, unlock powerful abilities that enhance your agility and combat skills, allowing you to <strong>navigate treacherous environments, face wild animals, and challenge formidable foes</strong> in your quest to <strong>rescue your father and uncover the mysteries of the Ursa clan</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight for Your Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival in the wild is a constant battle. But Adira is fierce and tenacious \u2014 she faces wild animals, navigates treacherous <strong>environments</strong>, and evolves into a skilled hunter<strong>, unlocking powerful new skills</strong> to overcome the challenges of the wilderness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551790/extras/919e7dd38e1b63358248d57554e541bd.poster.avif?t=1766011583\" width=1400 height=700 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551790/extras/919e7dd38e1b63358248d57554e541bd.webm?t=1766011583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551790/extras/919e7dd38e1b63358248d57554e541bd.mp4?t=1766011583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore an Untamed World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into a richly detailed stone-age setting filled with diverse wildlife, natural hazards, and breathtaking pixel environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551790/extras/b83ae3c1630202b808039c636ad40fb7.poster.avif?t=1766011583\" width=1400 height=700 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551790/extras/b83ae3c1630202b808039c636ad40fb7.webm?t=1766011583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551790/extras/b83ae3c1630202b808039c636ad40fb7.mp4?t=1766011583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master New Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adira may be small, but she is quick, she is agile, and she will learn a collection of skills \u2014 from spear thrusting to pole vaulting \u2014 that enable her to explore her surroundings and turn the tides of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551790/extras/cbe6c276ad482bac983cf1837de5c780.poster.avif?t=1766011583\" width=1400 height=700 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551790/extras/cbe6c276ad482bac983cf1837de5c780.webm?t=1766011583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551790/extras/cbe6c276ad482bac983cf1837de5c780.mp4?t=1766011583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Memorable Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter allies and adversaries whose paths shape Adira\u2019s fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551790/extras/582404ef48712857df937b3fb097353c.poster.avif?t=1766011583\" width=1400 height=700 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551790/extras/582404ef48712857df937b3fb097353c.webm?t=1766011583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551790/extras/582404ef48712857df937b3fb097353c.mp4?t=1766011583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Art &amp; Music</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose yourself in handcrafted pixel art and an atmospheric score that brings the wild to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551790/extras/dd8576519899d9d4f401fa6976efc55d.poster.avif?t=1766011583\" width=1400 height=700 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551790/extras/dd8576519899d9d4f401fa6976efc55d.webm?t=1766011583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551790/extras/dd8576519899d9d4f401fa6976efc55d.mp4?t=1766011583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The hunt begins. The bond endures.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now and prepare to step into the wild.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2551790?t=1766011583","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551790/c8c37d0e30541c42149b29d8405a300d84825128/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766011583","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551790/44ffee26939ec08e673ab840475b3416d3c1d57f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766011583","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551790/44ffee26939ec08e673ab840475b3416d3c1d57f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766011583","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id"