reathtaking pixel environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551790/extras/b83ae3c1630202b808039c636ad40fb7.poster.avif?t=1766011583\" width=1400 height=700 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551790/extras/b83ae3c1630202b808039c636ad40fb7.webm?t=1766011583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551790/extras/b83ae3c1630202b808039c636ad40fb7.mp4?t=1766011583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master New Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adira may be small, but she is quick, she is agile, and she will learn a collection of skills \u2014 from spear thrusting to pole vaulting \u2014 that enable her to explore her surroundings and turn the tides of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551790/extras/cbe6c276ad482bac983cf1837de5c780.poster.avif?t=1766011583\" width=1400 height=700 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551790/extras/cbe6c276ad482bac983cf1837de5c780.webm?t=1766011583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2551790/extras/cbe6c276ad482bac983cf1837de5c780.mp4?t=1766011583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Memorable Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter allies and adversaries whose paths shape Adira\u2019s fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic